{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1263170/extras/Gif1.gif?t=1746216980\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Starseed is an immersive farming sim that blends tranquility and subtle dark undertones in an atmosphere of isolation. Millions of miles from civilization, you find yourself alone on distant worlds, working without the distraction of combat. It\u2019s a peaceful experience about saving our home world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this farm sim there's no relationships to build, your interactions are with your machines, helper drones and with mission control back on Earth. You are millions of miles from the people you're trying to save!   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blast off and dive into the wonders of new worlds! Each planet is packed with unique features just waiting to be uncovered. Use what you find to your advantage, complete exciting missions, and unlock awesome upgrades to suit your playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Research:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dig deep into planetary secrets! Discover minerals, experiment with crops, or perfect your mining and manufacturing skills. The more you learn, the more powerful (and efficient) you become.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Craft:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Pioneer machines and cool gadgets to supercharge your journey. Set up machine networks, automate efficiently, and beam valuable resources back to HQ. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1263170/extras/Gif2.gif?t=1746216980\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Manage:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep resources flowing, power your machines, and make sure everything\u2019s running smoothly. Fulfill orders, stay self-sufficient, and build helpful drones to lend a mechanical hand with production.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>Atmosphere:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Breathe it all in. This journey is as chill as it is beautiful. With immersive soundscapes, soothing audio, and a dreamy soundtrack, you'll be wrapped in a serene,  ASMR-like vibe. Perfect for getting lost in the calm and soaking up every peaceful moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1263170/extras/Gif3.gif?t=1746216980\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Missions:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on a mix of handcrafted and procedurally generated missions! Earn cool rewards, unlock new tools, and boost your progress in unexpected ways. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Procedural Generation:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No boring repeats here - every adventure is a brand-new journey! From ever-changing cave systems and mines, to random events, missions, planets, and even the astronauts. Every playthrough offers something totally fresh. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1263170/extras/Gif4.gif?t=1746216980\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Bot Leader","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1263170/5a0672655b012254d94936a4196ec8a17c1cf10d.jpg"},{"name":"Furnace Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1263170/145e4c33292c332a6cc8e899f513d03a7839eb74.jpg"},{"name":"Apple Farmer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1263170/c53658e02586a2efc2cb00a38a0c12cf3718d0fe.jpg"},{"name":"Rocks Must Die","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1263170/ab1d7acd2a5c3934d4551